Key mappings:

X:				Delete line or trade currently under cursor (NOTE - DEL and BACKSPACE lose capture whenever cursor is clicked on another panel. NO idea, only affects these 2 keys.)
1, 2, 3, 4:		Select timeframe

A:				Show / hide active trade only (toggle)
F:				Show / hide floor trades (toggle)
L:				Show / hide liquidations (toggle)
C:				Show / hide closed trades (toggle)
V:				Show / hide all trades (toggle)
D:				Toggle draw mode

8				Set break even at price (show dialog)
9				Set ceiling at price (show dialog)
0				Set floor at price (show dialog)
B:				Show account balances
H:				Toggle heikin ashi
S:				Go to next symbol
S + L-SHIFT:	Go to previous symbol
R:				Go to next running symbol
C:				Go to next closed symbol
ESC:			Hide selection area box, stop drawing line, stop playing sound
K:				Backtest symbol with trade type (auto or manual) as hard-coded parameter
Q:				Stop backtest (mapped in Backtest_base)
Z:				Step backtest
I:				Invert chart